        "created_at": "2016-02-09T21:42:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Even if you don't have an extra power to use you can still use it to discard cards, which if you discard your equipment you can get it back with Salvage Yard.</p><p>It works great with Micro Assembler, as you can pull a tool from your deck and then use it for your regular power.</p>",
