        "created_at": "2016-08-01T01:34:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We had some off-turn card plays happening. I forget which we stuck on him first, but eventually Absolute Zero ended up beginning a turn with cards in play. That was the turn where stuff got crazy.</p>",
