      {
        "id": 126572,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-17T21:52:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've found that Argent Adept is fantastic with CC on the team -- since all of his outgoing damage is 1 HP, AA can ping any of the constructs easily. Scherzo of Frost and Flame becomes \"Heal whoever is next to the Vitality Conduit by 4 HP,\" or \"Whoever's next to Dynamic Syphon can use two powers.\"</p><p>Though Dynamic Syphon goes best on Tempest, I find, if there's a Cleansing Downpour out. Anything that hits all hero targets for 1 HP becomes heal all hero targets by 1 HP. Hitting all hero targets for 2 HP is neutralized. Have AA ping it, and&nbsp;<em>everyone</em>&nbsp;recovers 4 HP.</p>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:01:02.381Z",
