        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-18T10:12:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Once had a game where I was the Adept and got pretty well set up with a lot of my stuff. At some point Captain Cosmic put a Dymanic Siphon on me and then we just had everyone deliberately keep plinking it for one or two points of damage so I kept getting to use a whole bunch of powers over and over again, part of which included healing the Dynamic Siphon back up to full again &gt;:).</p>",
