        "created_at": "2017-02-27T03:06:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here’s another interesting feature: X-TREME Prime Warden Captain Cosmic can target his power use at a Vitality Conduit. That triggers a lot of healing!</p>\n<p>Same is true of Dynamic Siphon, of course, but you need it on a hero with lots of available powers to get the best effect.</p>",
