        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-27T16:27:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Well, you only get 3 triggers until it dies.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>True - but how many other ways are there to have an arbitrary hero regain 6 HP or get 3 off-turn power uses?</p>",
