        "created_at": "2017-03-22T06:18:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Huh.  That’s very clever.  And could possibly form an infinite loop with the Scholar with multiple energy forms. You would need one form to ping the conduit, one to ping the Scholar so that he could heal, and one to actually deal damage, but it should work.</p>",
